<title>USA: Palm Harbor Homes Inc Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Palm Harbor Homes Inc Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fourth Quarter Ended</p>
<p>						  Mar 28,	   Mar 29,</p>
<p>						    1997		1996</p>
<p> Net sales			     $138,944,000    $110,225,000</p>
<p> Net income				 6,955,000	 4,344,000</p>
<p> Net income per share			  0.46	   0.32(a)</p>
<p> Average shares outstanding	  15,097,000   13,566,000(a)</p>
<p>							 Year Ended</p>
<p>						  Mar 28,	   Mar 29,</p>
<p>						     1997	     1996</p>
<p> Net sales				563,192,000     417,214,000</p>
<p> Net income				24,739,000	14,978,000</p>
<p> Net income per share			  1.68	   1.18(a)</p>
<p> Average shares outstanding	  14,737,000   12,718,000(a)</p>
<p>(a) Share and per share figures for the fourth quarter and year ended March 29, 1996 have been adjusted to reflect the 5-for-4 stock split distributed to shareholders on August 2, 1996.</p>
